+# Tool Input Validation
+
+| Field  | Value                |
+| ------ | -------------------- |
+| Issue  | re-cinq/HALEngine#37 |
+| Status | Draft                |
+
+Tool calls arrive from a model and must be checked against the schema declared for the selected tool before the tool can act on them.
+
+## Requirements
+
+- `ToolRegistry.execute` validates an input against the resolved tool definition's `inputSchema` before invoking its executor; invalid input returns a `ToolResponse` describing the validation failure and does not invoke the executor ([validated by: rejects missing required input before invoking the executor](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L4)).
